sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor B as Browser
  participant API as API (any copy)
  participant BUS as Event bus
  participant W as Worker
  participant DB as Postgres (run_events)
  B->>API: GET /api/v1/orgs/{id}/events (SSE)
  API->>BUS: subscribe to this person's chats
  W->>BUS: token batch (every ~100 ms, not saved)
  BUS-->>API: token batch
  API-->>B: event: message.delta
  W->>DB: save event 812 "approval.requested"
  W->>BUS: "new event 812" (only the id)
  BUS-->>API: 812
  API->>DB: read event 812
  API-->>B: id: 812 · event: approval.requested
  Note over B,API: The connection drops (deploy, wifi)
  B->>API: reconnect with Last-Event-ID: 812
  API->>DB: read events after 812 for this person
  API-->>B: replay what was missed, then go live
